{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15828","headline":"送苏修游上饶 · 崔峒","name":"送苏修游上饶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱尔无羁束，云山恣意过。\n一身随远岫，孤棹任轻波。\n世事关情少，渔家寄宿多。\n芦花浅淡处，江月奈人何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔峒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15828.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15828","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}